    "answer": "No — I called that number not done. The 65.2% is specifically the top-3 hit rate on the 69 lots the scout didn't auto-lock (right card in the top 3 for 45 of those), with a wide interval, roughly 53 to 75%, given how few lots I had. On top of that, the truth set was my own taps, one tapper, five days, mostly English cards, so Japanese is barely tested. I said it's measurable and I know which number to move, but the excerpts don't give a target percentage I'd call done — no ship threshold for that metric is stated in the record.",
